# __Feature__

- **Result:** __the result that ships it, such as the reference result, `apps/`__
- **Decision:** [ADR 0045](../../.agents/decisions/0045-prds-state-intent-and-link-their-specs.md)
- **Covers:** `apps/web/src/routes/__feature__/**`, `apps/api/src/features/__feature__/**`
- Propose a behaviour or intent change with the [PRD change issue form](https://github.com/BenSheridanEdwards/AgenticRepoTemplate/issues/new?template=prd-change.yml).

## Intent

__Who the feature is for, what it lets them do, and why it exists. Copy this
file to docs/prd/<feature>.md. Every tracked Markdown file directly in
docs/prd/ is a PRD, and `pnpm check:docs` checks each one.__

__Replace the Covers examples with the code this feature governs. Keep exactly
one `- **Covers:**` line before the first `##` section, with comma-separated
repository-relative globs in single-backtick code spans. Use slash-separated
paths within the repository; each glob must match a tracked file present in the
working tree. The `Proved by` specs below count as covered automatically
([ADR 0058](../../.agents/decisions/0058-prds-name-the-code-they-cover.md)).__

